# Pairs with NoMixedTerminals. Deriving each leaf's terminal from that leaf's
# own vote instead of from the saga-wide decision is the classic per-participant
# outcome bug: a partially acked saga commits on the leaves that acked and
# aborts on the ones that did not.
MODULE: NoMixedTerminalsPerKeyVote
TARGET: NoMixedTerminals
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: derives each leaf's terminal from its own vote, so one saga both commits and aborts

--- FIND
    /\ LET kind == IF phase[t] = "committing" THEN "commit" ELSE "abort"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the terminal kind is per-participant rather than saga-wide, taken
\* from that participant's own prepare vote.
    /\ LET kind == IF vote[t][k] = "ack" THEN "commit" ELSE "abort"
--- END
